{"log":{"pages":[], "comment":"exported @ 7/31/2026 4:57:01 PM", "entries":[{"time":1060, "serverIPAddress":"18.65.207.19", "connection":"ClientPort:0;EgressPort:9235", "request":{"headersSize":461, "postData":{"text":"", "mimeType":""}, "queryString":[{"name":"ver", "value":"5.0.20253.3311"}, {"name":"tele", "value":"true"}, {"name":"meta", "value":"true"}], "headers":[{"name":"User-Agent", "value":"Fiddler/5.0.20253.3311 (.NET 4.8; WinNT 10.0.19045.0; en-US; 4xAMD64; Auto Update; Full Instance; Extensions: APITesting, AutoSaveExt, EventLog, FiddlerOrchestraAddon, HostsFile, RulesTab2, SAZClipboardFactory, SimpleFilter, Timeline)"}, {"name":"Pragma", "value":"no-cache"}, {"name":"Host", "value":"api.getfiddler.com"}, {"name":"Accept-Language", "value":"en-US"}, {"name":"Accept-Encoding", "value":"gzip, deflate"}, {"name":"Connection", "value":"close"}], "bodySize":0, "url":"https://api.getfiddler.com/fc/latest?ver=5.0.20253.3311&tele=true&meta=true", "cookies":[], "method":"GET", "httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1"}, "timings":{"blocked":-1, "ssl":318, "receive":41, "wait":255, "dns":356, "send":11, "connect":397}, "response":{"headersSize":787, "bodySize":4460, "statusText":"OK", "redirectURL":"", "status":200, "httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1", "cookies":[], "content":{"compression":0, "text":"5\r\n0\r\n20262\r\n6151\r\n\r\n\r\n5.0.20262.6151 [15/06/2026]\r\nfixes:\r\n Crash on startup when running on old Windows 10 machines\r\n Imported WebSocket sessions have incorrect path\r\n\r\n5.0.20261.4301 [30/04/2026]\r\nfeatures:\r\n Update application EULA\r\n Enable TLS 1.3 in supported HTTPS protocols\r\nfixes:\r\n Error while opening the CertMaker add-on configuration\r\n\r\n5.0.20253.3311 [31/03/2025]\r\nfixes:\r\n Application crashes on minimize\r\n\r\n5.0.20252.3251 [27/03/2025]\r\nfixes:\r\n Transcoder fails to load\r\n Consent dialog looks broken on high-DPI screens\r\n Update banner styles for unsupported functionalities\r\n Update third party dependencies to mitigate potential security vulnerabilities.\r\n\r\n5.0.20251.1171 [30/01/2025]\r\nfeatures:\r\n Add digital signature verification for external files.\r\n Show a confirmation dialog before loading unverified files.\r\n Show a confirmation dialog before opening files in an external application.\r\nfixes:\r\n Replace obsolete DotNetZip dependency with SharpZipLib.\r\n Update third party dependencies to mitigate potential security vulnerabilities.\r\n\r\n5.0.20245.10105 [17/10/2024]\r\nfeatures:\r\n Remove articles and banners from the \"Getting started\" page. \r\n Remove \"Offer for beta\" option. \r\nfixes:\r\n Update third party dependencies to mitigate potential security vulnerabilities.\r\n\r\n5.0.20244.10953 [06/08/2024]\r\nfixes:\r\n Update backend URLs for surveys\r\n Update third party dependencies to mitigate potential security vulnerabilities.\r\n\r\n5.0.20243.10853 [16/05/2024]\r\nfixes:\r\n Check for updates fails in the beta channel.\r\n Update third party dependencies to mitigate potential security vulnerabilities.\r\n\r\n5.0.20242.10753 [27/03/2024]\r\nfeatures:\r\n Show informational banners in cases where some functionalities are not supported\r\n Add tls1.1 and tls1.2 in the default HTTPS supported protocols for decryption (for new installations only)\r\n\r\nfixes:\r\n Changing fonts breaks the TextView tab by hiding the search option\r\n Saving SAZ file fails when there are more than 62K sessions\r\n Check for update fails when tls1.2 is not added in the HTTPS supported protocols\r\n Host Remapping tool fails to override certificate behavior for requests created by Fiddler Classic\r\n Export as cURL uses -d instead of --data-raw which causes security issues in some rare cases\r\n An unnecessary log is printed when ClientHello's length is greater than 255 bytes\r\n\r\n5.0.20211.51073 [15/12/2021]\r\nfeatures:\r\n Change the name to Progress Telerik Fiddler Classic\r\n Add Cross-Origin headers to Response Header Security section\r\n Throw HTTP protocol violation when a header name contains a space\r\n\r\nfixes:\r\n TLS ClientHello and ServerHello parsing fails when there are large extensions\r\n Change the validity period for dynamically created certificates in Fiddler Classic to be less than an year\r\n Update Set-Cookie header template as it is expired\r\n HostnameIs method might return true even when host does not match when it has port\r\n Incorrectly strips Authorization header if it happens to contain the letters NTLM\r\n Fiddler Auth Inspector should decode BASIC credentials using Encoding.UTF8\r\n Error window at launch may be hard to find\r\n TLS Handshake Analyzer omits the last value in the supported_versions extension\r\n Process picker option is not working for Chromium based browsers\r\n \"Set AutoResponder comment\" hotkey moves list selection\r\n\r\n\r\n5.0.20204.45441 [11/03/2020]\r\nfixes:\r\n Fix Copy | Session menu item in the Web Sessions List context menu.\r\n Fix Copy | Headers menu item in the Web Sessions List context menu.\r\n Remove the possibility to start a local executable without user's permission: CVE-2020-13661, reported by Lion Nagenrauft, nagenrauft-consulting.com\r\n\r\n5.0.20202.18177 [04/21/2020]\r\nfeatures:\r\n \"Accept all CONNECTs\" option in AutoResponder\r\n\r\nfixes:\r\n Quick filters - removed filter cannot be reapplied\r\n Various bugfixes and improvements\r\n\r\n5.0.20194.41348 [10/03/2019]\r\nfeatures:\r\n Ability to preserve filters in Fiddler\r\n New GetStarted tab\r\n Ability to group AutoResponder rules\r\n Fiddler recognizes MSEdge and Brave as web browsers\r\n New preference fiddler.knownbrowsers - comma-separated list with processes that Fiddler recognizes as browsers\r\n\r\nfixes:\r\n Ctrl+Shift+C and Ctrl+C shortcuts do not copy\r\n m shortcut changes selection in AutoResponder tab\r\n Minor bug fixes\r\n\r\n@WELCOME@\r\nAre you sweating on building JavaScript UI?\r\n\r\nSpeed up your development by using Kendo UI library for your next project - http://prgress.co/2swAPLK\r\n", "size":4460, "mimeType":"text/plain"}, "headers":[{"name":"Content-Type", "value":"text/plain"}, {"name":"Connection", "value":"close"}, {"name":"Date", "value":"Fri, 31 Jul 2026 08:51:09 GMT"}, {"name":"Signature", "value":"SignedHeaders=content-type;x-date;x-signature-timestamp, Signature=AAAAWzBZMBMGByqGSM49AgEGCCqGSM49AwEHA0IABNsAzGwa7Q3iTZFqv3xYHemw/qxkwk0sIC/usJVi7713VJv0B1JbfuiDXxHfScNyyQjkuaHKtwbn5qUeHjFwpGYtPGhke9Bsp80wnG7YPS0YyJfsi3zSg5g7B1RwVNB7ZamsWybsYemNZgTS9DSragv/NYteM8V6rT0k+61BsqHc"}, {"name":"api-supported-versions", "value":"1.0"}, {"name":"Server", "value":"Kestrel"}, {"name":"Vary", "value":"Accept-Encoding"}, {"name":"X-Date", "value":"Fri, 31 Jul 2026 08:51:09 GMT"}, {"name":"x-signature-timestamp", "value":"1785487869"}, {"name":"X-Cache", "value":"Miss from cloudfront"}, {"name":"Via", "value":"1.1 d25e24c9a13b2767614250566b710590.cloudfront.net (CloudFront)"}, {"name":"X-Amz-Cf-Pop", "value":"NRT57-P3"}, {"name":"Alt-Svc", "value":"h3=\":443\"; ma=86400"}, {"name":"X-Amz-Cf-Id", "value":"x6cvFr50h0YbCIy2TxIkJVp6pDbSAQvwVJUwNwZpqPPV-aGe2nhYRQ=="}, {"name":"Content-Length", "value":"4460"}]}, "startedDateTime":"2026-07-31T16:51:07.9496714+08:00", "cache":{}}, {"time":334, "connection":"ClientPort:7585;EgressPort:7616", "comment":"[#2]", "request":{"headersSize":1267, "postData":{"text":"", "mimeType":""}, "queryString":[], "headers":[{"name":"Host", "value":"parms42test.csitech.com"}, {"name":"Connection", "value":"keep-alive"}, {"name":"Upgrade-Insecure-Requests", "value":"1"}, {"name":"User-Agent", "value":"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"}, {"name":"Accept", "value":"text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/avif,image/webp,image/apng,*/*;q=0.8,application/signed-exchange;v=b3;q=0.7"}, {"name":"Sec-Fetch-Site", "value":"same-origin"}, {"name":"Sec-Fetch-Mode", "value":"navigate"}, {"name":"Sec-Fetch-User", "value":"?1"}, {"name":"Sec-Fetch-Dest", "value":"document"}, {"name":"sec-ch-ua", "value":"\"Not;A=Brand\";v=\"8\", \"Chromium\";v=\"150\", \"Google Chrome\";v=\"150\""}, {"name":"sec-ch-ua-mobile", "value":"?0"}, {"name":"sec-ch-ua-platform", "value":"\"Windows\""}, {"name":"Referer", "value":"https://parms42test.csitech.com/RMS/Home"}, {"name":"Accept-Encoding", "value":"gzip, deflate, br, zstd"}, {"name":"Accept-Language", "value":"en-US,en;q=0.9"}, {"name":"Cookie", "value":"IDReaderCommPort=COM1; .AspNetCore.Antiforgery.im7NZdQjnVA=CfDJ8Lt5bHFAdgVKqAT8TxuezcnsnVhnAHFTVhGStVuI3cY-EuTLnNvrYbCsLlZ00YGrDMS8B3fCAQgckADl2s63KbYEZufKGgEQE9CLXqb4jrcnPCfdFwsuSWrYl0nFs4On6Qc6ytZ9toU2z_IqfmAp4cU; .CSI.Session.RMS=CfDJ8Lt5bHFAdgVKqAT8TxuezckYUtAhKejM3HcT7hhnBIZ7f9RD0fdd0KlrT%2FRYkSltP6pNfe%2FcSsjXEM8sLw95TJEk780WRWkEKg6jD4nL%2Bw%2FQlmtIvAV4FUMKo192Xhvc%2BbapNpcBO6QZ%2BksLzePy2sVkGLDVQqoAlHi6ZbGyMbCv; tto=1440; tst=0; clientVersion=3.0.1.88; style_sheet_night=day"}], "bodySize":0, "url":"https://parms42test.csitech.com/RMS/Login", "cookies":[{"name":"IDReaderCommPort", "value":"COM1"}, {"name":".AspNetCore.Antiforgery.im7NZdQjnVA", "value":"CfDJ8Lt5bHFAdgVKqAT8TxuezcnsnVhnAHFTVhGStVuI3cY-EuTLnNvrYbCsLlZ00YGrDMS8B3fCAQgckADl2s63KbYEZufKGgEQE9CLXqb4jrcnPCfdFwsuSWrYl0nFs4On6Qc6ytZ9toU2z_IqfmAp4cU"}, {"name":".CSI.Session.RMS", "value":"CfDJ8Lt5bHFAdgVKqAT8TxuezckYUtAhKejM3HcT7hhnBIZ7f9RD0fdd0KlrT%2FRYkSltP6pNfe%2FcSsjXEM8sLw95TJEk780WRWkEKg6jD4nL%2Bw%2FQlmtIvAV4FUMKo192Xhvc%2BbapNpcBO6QZ%2BksLzePy2sVkGLDVQqoAlHi6ZbGyMbCv"}, {"name":"tto", "value":"1440"}, {"name":"tst", "value":"0"}, {"name":"clientVersion", "value":"3.0.1.88"}, {"name":"style_sheet_night", "value":"day"}], "method":"GET", "httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1"}, "timings":{"blocked":-1, "ssl":0, "receive":0, "wait":334, "dns":0, "send":0, "connect":0}, "response":{"headersSize":247, "bodySize":9523, "statusText":"OK", "redirectURL":"", "status":200, "httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1", "cookies":[], "content":{"compression":0, "text":"\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\r\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\r\n\t<title>INFOSHARE 4.0 Login</title>\t\r\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/RMS/css/infoshareui/infoshareui-V2.0/infoshareui.min.css?v=_w7FQ7jMbU1iCxzx-P5OMEMGsavJOQnFpqnlib-poic\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/RMS/css/login.css?v=ZLDv5ZUFLGA_wdCZBiGKVDaam4e0X1K6Mn6daSmn5Xs\" />\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\t<form method=\"post\" onsubmit=\"return CheckBeforeSubmit()\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column vh-100 justify-content-between\">\r\n\t\t\t<main>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"body-bg h-screen d-flex flex-column justify-content-between position-relative overflow-auto\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"w-100 mt-14\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"login-logo-section\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container site-logo\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container mt-5\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"text-uppercase text-white\">Production Title</h5>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-6xl text-uppercase fw-semibold text-white\"><span style=\"text-transform: none;\">Lancaster County<br>Records Management System</span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-grid gap-3 mt-4 w-20\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"form-control login-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Username\" id=\"LoginId\" name=\"LoginId\" value=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"input-group\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"form-control login-input\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Password\" autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"Password\" name=\"Password\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn login-input border-0 ms-0\" type=\"button\" id=\"button-password\" href=\"/RMS/AspSoft/Security/ForgotPassword\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/RMS/images/help_icon.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-grid gap-3 my-4 w-20\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light login-button text-uppercase\">Login</button>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"usbKeyValue\" name=\"usbKeyValue\" />\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"computerNameValue\" name=\"computerNameValue\" />\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<footer>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column align-items-end p-5\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-info border border-info text-lg py-2 px-3 mb-3 rounded-5\"> - 10.10.2.130 </div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/RMS/images/infoshare-logo.svg\" alt=\"InfoShare\" class=\"me-2\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-sm text-white opacity-50\">Copyright \u00a9 CSI Technology Group. All rights reserved.</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-bg-info position-absolute top-0 w-100 p-3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">   \r\n  <div style=\"text-align:left;display:block;color: #ffffff;\">*** NOTICE ***</div>  \r\n  <div style=\"color: #ffffff;\">  \r\n   <span>This is a restricted information system. System usage may be monitored, recorded, and subject to audit. Unauthorized use of this system is prohibited and may be subject to criminal and/or civil penalties. \r\nUse of this system indicates consent to monitoring and recording.</span>  \r\n  </div>  \r\n  </div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</main>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t<input name=\"__RequestVerificationToken\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"CfDJ8Lt5bHFAdgVKqAT8TxuezcnxW08RfPClHWqeGMDe6qEDbbQ1nBRAt_WP9u9haUHBrLKpABVOrBUrtlvzhOonLlh5VcvyBftn7DK1HTtQVfngJD8hrPKYezVGv3ofbXiIeeBkYGav2zZaPTqyduuL0p8\" /></form>\r\n\r\n\t<script src=\"/RMS/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js\"></script>\r\n\t<script src=\"/RMS/js/global.js?v=1f3CwWam8TavC2uqWUrDlCa2LyayLQQgSx5WjKSrx8Q\"></script>\r\n\t<script src=\"/RMS/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\r\n\t<script src=\"/RMS/lib/jquery-validation/jquery.validate.min.js\"></script>\r\n<script src=\"/RMS/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\t\tvar changedPwd = false;\r\n\t\tvar __client_request_root_url = \"/RMS/\";\r\n\t\tvar _enableUSBKeyCheck = false;\r\n\t\tvar _hasUSBLoginType = false;\r\n\t\tvar _enableInfoClient = true;\r\n\t\tvar _showTokeCode =false;\r\n\t\tvar _showNextTokenCode=false;\r\n\r\n\t\tvar _directPost = false;\r\n\r\n\t\t$(function ()\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\tmyLoad();\r\n\t\t\t$(\"input[tip]\").each(function ()\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t$(this).tipInput($(this).attr(\"tip\"));\r\n\t\t\t});\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif ($(\"#LoginId\").val() || $(\"#LoginId\").text())\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#Password\").focus();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\telse\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#LoginId\").focus();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\t$(\"#Password\").change(function ()\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\tchangedPwd = true;\r\n\t\t\t});\r\n\r\n\t\t\tinitializeComputerName();\t\t\t\r\n\t\t});\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\tfunction initializeComputerName()\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\tif (_enableUSBKeyCheck && _hasUSBLoginType)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\tif (_enableInfoClient)\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\tinitializeWithWebSocket();\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tfunction initializeWithWebSocket()\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t$(function ()\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\tconst ws = new WebSocket(\"ws://127.0.0.1:19999/SystemService\");\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tws.onopen = function (evt)\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\tconsole.log(\"connect success\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\tws.send(\"GetComputerName\");\r\n\t\t\t\t};\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tws.onmessage = function (evt)\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t$(\"#spanComputerName\").text(evt.data);\r\n\t\t\t\t\tconsole.log(\"receive message: \" + evt.data);\r\n\t\t\t\t\tws.close();\r\n\t\t\t\t};\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tws.onerror = function (evt)\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\tconsole.log(\"error message: \" + evt.type);\r\n\t\t\t\t\talert(\"Please install InfoClient first.\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.open(ResolveClientUrl(\"~/Package/InfoClient-Install.exe\"));\r\n\t\t\t\t};\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tws.onclose = function (evt)\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\tconsole.log(\"connection closed\");\r\n\t\t\t\t};\r\n\t\t\t});\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tfunction CheckBeforeSubmit()\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\tif (_directPost)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\treturn true;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif ($(\"#LoginId\").length === 0 || $(\"#Password\").length === 0)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\treturn true;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tconst checkResult = CheckInput();\r\n\t\t\tif (checkResult === false)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif (_enableUSBKeyCheck &&_hasUSBLoginType)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\treturn CheckUSBKey();\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\treturn true;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tfunction checkUSBKeyWithWebSocket()\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\tconst computerName = $(\"#spanComputerName\").text();\r\n\t\t\tconst userName = $(\"#LoginId\").val();\r\n\r\n\t\t\tvar url = \"?handler=CheckNoNeedUsbKey&rnd=\" + Math.random();\r\n\t\t\tconst noNeedResponse = $.ajax({\r\n\t\t\t\ttype: \"POST\",\r\n\t\t\t\tdata: {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tcomputer_name: computerName,\r\n\t\t\t\t\tuser_name: userName\r\n\t\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t\t\turl: url,\r\n\t\t\t\tasync: false\r\n\t\t\t});\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif (noNeedResponse === \"1\")\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#computerNameValue\").val(computerName);\r\n\t\t\t\treturn true;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\ttry\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\tconst ws = new WebSocket(\"ws://127.0.0.1:19999/SystemService\");\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tconst plainKey = new Promise((resolve, reject) =>\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\tws.onopen = function ()\r\n\t\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tws.send(\"GetPlainKey\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\t};\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\tws.onmessage = function (evt)\r\n\t\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tresolve(evt.data);\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tws.close();\r\n\t\t\t\t\t};\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\tws.onerror = function (evt)\r\n\t\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\treject(new Error(\"WebSocket error\"));\r\n\t\t\t\t\t};\r\n\t\t\t\t});\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tif (!plainKey)\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\talert(\"Authentication Failed: \\n Please insert your USB Key to continue.\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tconst checkResponse = $.ajax({\r\n\t\t\t\t\ttype: \"POST\",\r\n\t\t\t\t\tdata: {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tuser_name: userName,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tuser_plain_key: plainKey\r\n\t\t\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t\t\t\turl: \"?handler=CeckUSBKey&rnd=\" + Math.random(),\r\n\t\t\t\t\tasync: false\r\n\t\t\t\t});\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\tif (checkResponse !== \"1\")\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\talert(\"Authentication Failed: \\n Your USB Key is Invalid.\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#usbKeyValue\").val(plainKey);\r\n\t\t\t\t_directPost = true;\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"button[type=submit]\").trigger(\"click\");\r\n\t\t\t\treturn true;\r\n\r\n\t\t\t} catch (error)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\tconsole.error(\"Error:\", error);\r\n\t\t\t\talert(\"Authentication Failed: \\n Please check if you register ebCrypt.dll.\");\r\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tfunction CheckInput()\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\tvar regStr = \"^[0-9a-zA-Z_]{1,50}$\"; //username and password format required\r\n\t\t\tvar loginID = $(\"#LoginId\").val();\r\n\t\t\tvar password = $(\"#Password\").val();\r\n\t\t\tvar tokencodeID = _showTokeCode ?? $(\"#TokenCode\");\r\n\t\t\tvar tokencode = tokencodeID != \"\" ? $(\"#TokenCode\").val() : null;\r\n\t\t\tvar nextTokencodeID = _showNextTokenCode ?? $(\"#NextTokenCode\");\r\n\t\t\tvar nextTokencode = nextTokencodeID != \"\" ? document.getElementById(nextTokencodeID).value : null;\r\n\r\n\t\t\tvar reg = new RegExp(regStr);\r\n\t\t\tif (loginID.match(reg) != loginID)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\tif (loginID == \"\")\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\talert(\"Please input the username.\");\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\telse\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\talert(\"Invalid username or password\");\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#LoginId\").focus();\r\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\tif (password == \"\")\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\talert(\"Please input the password.\");\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#Password\").focus();\r\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\tif (tokencodeID != \"\" && tokencode == \"\")\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\talert(\"Please input the Tokencode.\");\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#TokenCode\").focus();\r\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\tif (nextTokencodeID != \"\" && nextTokencode == \"\")\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\talert(\"Please input the Next tokencode.\");\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#NextTokencode\").focus();\r\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\tvar p = new RegExp(\"^[A-Za-z0-9]+$\");\r\n\t\t\tvar specialList = '!\"#$%&\\'()*+,-./:;<=>?@[\\\\]^_`{|}~';\r\n\t\t\tfor (var i = 0; i < password.length; i++)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\tvar sChar = password.substr(i, 1);\r\n\t\t\t\tif (!(p.exec(sChar) || specialList.indexOf(sChar) >= 0))\r\n\t\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t\talert('Password is in a wrong format..');\r\n\t\t\t\t\t$(\"#Password\").focus();\r\n\t\t\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\tif (changedPwd)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\t$(\"#Password\").val(btoa(password));\r\n\t\t\t\tchangedPwd = false;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t\treturn true;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tfunction myLoad()\r\n\t\t{\r\n\t\t\tif (parent.frames.length > 0)\r\n\t\t\t{\r\n\t\t\t\ttop.window.location = self.location;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t</script>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>", "size":9523, "mimeType":"text/html; charset=utf-8"}, "headers":[{"name":"Cache-Control", "value":"no-cache, no-store"}, {"name":"Pragma", "value":"no-cache"}, {"name":"Content-Type", "value":"text/html; charset=utf-8"}, {"name":"Vary", "value":"Accept-Encoding"}, {"name":"Server", "value":"Microsoft-IIS/10.0"}, {"name":"X-Powered-By", "value":"ASP.NET"}, {"name":"Da