encyCase96\",\"url\":\"/RMS/inbox/list?nextPID=listInbox_AllAgencyCase96\\u0026inbox_staff_id=1\\u0026inbox_sub_id=10030106\\u0026UseDefault=1\\u0026is_temp_page_size=1\\u0026page_size=100\"},{\"inboxId\":100301,\"inboxDesc\":\"RMS - Officer\",\"inboxSubId\":10030107,\"inboxSubName\":\"All Agency Cases (72 hours)\",\"inboxSubPageId\":\"listInbox_AllAgencyCase24\",\"url\":\"/RMS/inbox/list?nextPID=listInbox_AllAgencyCase24\\u0026inbox_staff_id=1\\u0026inbox_sub_id=10030107\\u0026UseDefault=1\\u0026is_temp_page_size=1\\u0026page_size=100\"},{\"inboxId\":100301,\"inboxDesc\":\"RMS - Officer\",\"inboxSubId\":10030108,\"inboxSubName\":\"All Agency Cases (12 hours)\",\"inboxSubPageId\":\"listInbox_AllAgencyCase12\",\"url\":\"/RMS/inbox/list?nextPID=listInbox_AllAgencyCase12\\u0026inbox_staff_id=1\\u0026inbox_sub_id=10030108\\u0026UseDefault=1\\u0026is_temp_page_size=1\\u0026page_size=100\"}],\r\n\t\t\t\tget favoriteMenus(){\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlet data = [];\r\n\t\t\t\t\tthis.menuCategories.forEach((category)=>{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tcategory.menuItems.forEach((item)=>{\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tif(item.isFavorite){\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata.push({\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t ...item,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t categoryId:category.id\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t});\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t});\r\n\t\t\t\t\t});\r\n\t\t\t\t\treturn data;\r\n\t\t\t\t},\r\n\t\t\t\tasync modifyFavoriteMenu(categoryId,menuId) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlet category = this.menuCategories.find(i=>i.id == categoryId);\r\n\t\t\t\t\tlet menuItem = category.menuItems.find(i=>i.id == menuId);\r\n\t\t\t\t\tconst isFav = !menuItem.isFavorite;\r\n\t\t\t\t\tconst url = `${ResolveClientUrl(\"~/Aspsoft/HomeHandler/modifyFavoriteMenu\")}?nodeId=${menuId}&isFav=${isFav}`;\r\n\t\t\t\t\tconst response = await fetch(url, {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmethod: \"POST\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t})\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif(response.ok) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmenuItem.isFavorite = !menuItem.isFavorite;\r\n\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t}));\r\n\t\t});\r\n</script>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"app-main\" id=\"